<title>USA: Pratt &amp; Whitney gets $60 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Pratt &amp; Whitney gets $60 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pratt &amp; Whitney, a unit of United Technologies Corp, said Tuesday it has received a 10-year contract from  Uzbekistan Airways to maintain a fleet of the airline's engines.</p>
<p>The contract is worth about $60 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Pratt &amp; Whitney is to maintain Uzbekistan Airways' PW4000 and PW2000 engines.</p>
</text>
